WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.662
A quick word on how the
workbook itself works.

2
00:00:02.662 --> 00:00:07.740
It's nineteen books, numbered along the
same dependency chain the program follows:

3
00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.801
identity first, then the
estate's infrastructure,

4
00:00:10.801 --> 00:00:13.563
then the boundary,
assurance and operations.

5
00:00:13.563 --> 00:00:17.977
Every book asks the same four
questions, why, what, who and how,

6
00:00:17.977 --> 00:00:22.212
so once you know one, you can
find your way around any other.

7
00:00:22.212 --> 00:00:24.957
And each topic has one home; for example,

8
00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:28.475
The Transformation Arc
owns the phases and gates.

9
00:00:28.475 --> 00:00:30.513
Statements come in three kinds.

10
00:00:30.513 --> 00:00:33.731
External facts are footnoted
to a primary source,

11
00:00:33.731 --> 00:00:36.087
checked on the day the book was built.

12
00:00:36.087 --> 00:00:40.249
Program positions are the program's
own view, open to argument.

13
00:00:40.249 --> 00:00:43.252
And illustrative examples
are labeled as such;

14
00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:46.562
the case studies are patterns,
not real engagements.

15
00:00:46.562 --> 00:00:51.712
Each chapter also keeps a verification
file, so every correction is visible.

16
00:00:51.712 --> 00:00:53.180
Now, what is the program?
